;; The media registrations wineboot's RegisterDllsSection makes at run time and the WINE_REGISTRY
;; scripts do not carry: DirectShow filters (IFilterMapper2::RegisterFilter) and their categories,
;; DMOs (DMORegister) and Media Foundation transforms (MFTRegister), as a desktop prefix of the
;; same Wine (wineboot --init) holds them. Each section names the DLL whose DllRegisterServer
;; writes it; app/tools/prefix-registry.py MEDIA_REGISTER_SHA256 guards that code.
;; quartz's Color Space Converter (wine-11.20) is what wine-11.20's quartz.dll DllRegisterServer
;; wrote into a desktop wine-11.19 prefix (its WoW64 view; every other quartz entry here is equal
;; there), not a wineboot'ed wine-11.20 prefix (docs/evidence/2026-10-18-wine-11.20.md).

